{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared cross-language vectors for the consumer-policy validator (steuerbare",
    "Verbraucher, docs/verbrauchssteuerung.md §10). The SEMANTIC rules JSON Schema",
    "cannot express are implemented byte-for-byte identically in Java",
    "(services/api .../consumers/ConsumerPolicyValidator) and TS (frontend/portal/",
    "src/consumers/validate.ts); BOTH test suites load THIS file and must produce",
    "the same verdict per case (the topology-vectors.json / FlowGraphValidator /",
    "EdgeRef precedent). Change the rules on both sides + these vectors together.",
    "",
    "Each case: `document` is a full consumer-policy document; `expect` is either",
    "\"valid\" (no error findings) or { rule } (the error findings MUST contain that",
    "rule code). The JSON-Schema-level shape is checked separately by the ajv run",
    "over docs/contracts/v2/examples/consumer-policy.*.json; these vectors exercise",
    "the semantics ABOVE the schema.",
    "",
    "Signal catalog (ConsumerSignalCatalog): cloud-compiled (no hysteresis / no",
    "max_age_s, D1) = market.spot_price_ct_kwh, market.import_price_ct_kwh; local",
    "(may carry reset_value + max_age_s) = storage.soc_pct, site.pv_surplus_kw,",
    "site.grid_power_kw (number) and consumer.vehicle_connected, consumer.available",
    "(boolean). Limits: MAX_TREE_DEPTH 4, MAX_TREE_NODES 24, MAX_REQUIREMENTS 32."
  ],
  "limits": { "max_tree_depth": 4, "max_tree_nodes": 24, "max_requirements": 32 },
  "signal_catalog": {
    "market.spot_price_ct_kwh": { "class": "cloud", "value_type": "number" },
    "market.import_price_ct_kwh": { "class": "cloud", "value_type": "number" },
    "storage.soc_pct": { "class": "local", "value_type": "number" },
    "site.pv_surplus_kw": { "class": "local", "value_type": "number" },
    "site.grid_power_kw": { "class": "local", "value_type": "number" },
    "consumer.vehicle_connected": { "class": "local", "value_type": "boolean" },
    "consumer.available": { "class": "local", "value_type": "boolean" }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "heater-window-and-reactive-or",
      "expect": "valid",
      "document": {
        "schema_version": "1.0",
        "entity_id": "heater-01",
        "timezone": "Europe/Berlin",
        "requirements": [
          {
            "id": "heater-noon",
            "kind": "fixed_window",
            "enforcement": "must_run",
            "recurrence": { "days": "daily", "from": "13:00", "to": "14:00" },
            "target": { "kind": "on_off", "value": true }
          },
          {
            "id": "heater-cheap-or-full",
            "kind": "reactive",
            "enforcement": "must_run",
            "condition": {
              "any": [
                { "signal": "market.spot_price_ct_kwh", "operator": "lt", "value": 5 },
                { "signal": "storage.soc_pct", "operator": "gt", "value": 80, "reset_value": 75, "max_age_s": 30 }
              ]
            },
            "target": { "kind": "on_off", "value": true }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
